OL,3,AMen jailed over #70m tree-planting
OL,4,Ainvestment scam
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree men have been jailed over a
OL,7,Fmulti-million pound tree-planting scam
OL,8,Fthat cost nearly 3,000 investors their
OL,9,Fsavings or pensions.
OL,11,FMatthew Pickard, 55, Stephen Greenaway,
OL,12,F48, and Paul Laver, 48, bought luxury
OL,13,Fhomes, cars and yachts from the profits
OL,14,Fof Bournemouth-based Ethical Forestry
OL,15,FLtd, which promised forestry
OL,16,Finvestments in Costa Rica.
OL,18,FThe firm took #70m from small investors
OL,19,Fbefore it collapsed in 2015, Southwark
OL,20,FCrown Court heard.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
