OL,3,AMen jailed over #70m tree-planting
OL,4,Ainvestment scam
OL,5,
OL,6,FPickard, who pleaded guilty to
OL,7,Ffraudulent trading, was jailed for six
OL,8,Fyears. Greenaway and Laver, who also
OL,9,Fadmitted the charge, received sentences
OL,10,Fof five years and three months and four
OL,11,Fand a half years respectively.
